{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad628a40bba45a34899f88223a923096aabcf50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{n+4}-2(2^{n})}{2(2^{n+3})}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"101\" height=\"43\" /> when simplified is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e5cafd5238b888857eb9ee32149ed5c11344705.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2^{n+1}-\\frac{1}{8}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -2^{n+1}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1-2^{n}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{7}{8}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"505\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/5/d45b25174681cec74ddcb4efb52aab9f4a80ca7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(2^n)=2^{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8ae8c3173e28420e64a02408f17fef168009abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(2^{n+3})=2^{n+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d663abdb360d58c621f5b916a9dddd8e2860137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{n+4}-2(2^{n})}{2(2^{n+3})}=\\dfrac{2^{n+4}-2^{n+1}}{2^{n+4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"221\" height=\"43\" />. Factoring out a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/6/d06ff0c90bc6f81e31faecaba622165272fe2cda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{n+1}$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> in the numerator, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0ea61a25a87d7d36e81a8d809fb20ba6b9db6479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2^{n+1}(2^3-1)}{2^{n+4}}=\\dfrac{8-1}{2^3}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{7}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"253\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td